OL,3,GNEWSAMan reveals heartbreak of losing
OL,4,Afamily in Nepal floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who lost his family in floods in
OL,7,FNepal says he struggles to accept that
OL,8,Fthey are gone as he speaks of his
OL,9,Fheartbreak after returning from the
OL,10,Fcountry.
OL,12,FPramod Poudel, 34, from Uckfield, East
OL,13,FSussex, travelled to Nepal after losing
OL,14,Fcontact with his wife Sumitra, mother
OL,15,FTulisa, brother Pardip and uncle Madhav
OL,16,Ffollowing the disaster. He says now he
OL,17,Fdoes not believe they will be found.
OL,19,FAbout 1,400 people died while more than
OL,20,F6,000 people are still missing
OL,21,Ffollowing the disaster, according to
OL,22,Fofficial data.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
